"Language-Team: German <gnome-de@gnome.org>\n"
"Language: de\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);\n"

#. TRANSLATORS: shown when a new recurring appointment could not be
#. saved. %1$s is the date and time the series ends, as it was
#. written in the appointment; %2$s is a time zone identifier such
#. as "Europe/Berlin".
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-cal/src/ops.rs:538
#, c-format
msgid ""
""
"This event repeats until %1$s, and the time zone it is in, %2$s, is not "
"defined in this calendar entry in a way that instant can be converted out of "
"— so the event was not created. Stating the recurrence as a repeat count "
"works instead."
msgstr ""
"Dieser Termin wiederholt sich bis %1$s, und die zugehörige Zeitzone"
"%2$s ist in diesem Kalendereintrag nicht so definiert, dass dieser"
"Zeitpunkt umgewandelt werden kann, sodass der Termin nicht erstellt"
"wurde. Die Angabe der Wiederholung als Anzahl von Wiederholungen"
"funktioniert stattdessen."

#. TRANSLATORS: shown when a new recurring appointment could not be
#. saved, and the reason is not something the user can be pointed
#. at more precisely than this.
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-cal/src/ops.rs:547
msgid ""
""
"This event repeats in a way that cannot be stored on the server, so it was "
"not created. Stating the recurrence as a repeat count is the spelling that "
"always works."
msgstr ""
"Dieser Termin wiederholt sich auf eine Weise, die auf dem Server nicht"
"gespeichert werden kann, sodass er nicht erstellt wurde. Die Angabe der"
"Wiederholung als Anzahl von Wiederholungen funktioniert immer."

#. TRANSLATORS: names one of an account's two kinds of
#. server-side collection, inside a sentence describing an
#. account error.
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-core/src/connect.rs:67
msgid "address book"
msgstr "Adressbuch"

#. TRANSLATORS: names one of an account's two kinds of
#. server-side collection, inside a sentence describing an
#. account error.
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-core/src/connect.rs:73
msgid "calendar"
msgstr "Kalender"

#. TRANSLATORS: shown when an account configured with a user
#. name has no password stored for it yet.
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-core/src/connect.rs:144
msgid "the account has no password yet"
msgstr "das Konto hat noch kein Passwort"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is "address book" or "calendar"; %2$s is
#. the identifier this account is configured to use for it,
#. which the server does not have.
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-core/src/connect.rs:154
#, c-format
msgid "the account names %1$s \"%2$s\", which the server does not have"
msgstr "das Konto nennt %1$s »%2$s«, was auf dem Server nicht vorhanden ist"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is "address book" or "calendar".
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-core/src/connect.rs:159
#, c-format
msgid "the server offers no default %1$s for this account"
msgstr "der Server bietet kein Standard-%1$s für dieses Konto an"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is "address book" or "calendar".
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-core/src/connect.rs:570
#, c-format
msgid "the %1$s backend has no account to connect to"
msgstr "das Backend für %1$s hat kein Konto, mit dem es sich verbinden kann"

#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-core/src/oauth2.rs:706
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-core/src/oauth2.rs:833
#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/link.rs:269 rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/link.rs:274
#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:1071
#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:1074
#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:1095
msgid "no further detail was given"
msgstr "keine weiteren Details angegeben"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is the message bus's own text naming which service
#. has no owner, e.g. "The name :1.4 was not provided by any .service
#. files".
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-core/src/oauth2.rs:705
#, c-format
msgid ""
""
"a service this account's sign-in needs is not running, so no access token "
"could be fetched: %1$s"
msgstr ""
"ein für die Anmeldung dieses Kontos erforderlicher Dienst läuft nicht,"
"daher konnte kein Zugriffstoken abgerufen werden: %1$s"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is EDS's own message for why the
#. account's secret store (keyring) could not be reached.
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-core/src/oauth2.rs:832
#, c-format
msgid "the account's secret store (keyring) could not be reached: %1$s"
msgstr ""
"der Passwortspeicher (Schlüsselbund) des Kontos konnte nicht erreicht"
"werden: %1$s"

#. TRANSLATORS: shown instead of a fresh sign-in window when
#. the account's stored token cannot be read because the
#. system keyring is locked, which signing in again cannot
#. fix.
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-core/src/oauth2.rs:864
msgid ""
""
"the login keyring is locked, so this account's OAuth 2.0 token can be "
"neither read nor stored; unlock the keyring and try again"
msgstr ""
"der Anmeldeschlüsselbund ist gesperrt, sodass das OAuth-2.0-Token"
"dieses Kontos weder gelesen noch gespeichert werden kann; entsperren Sie"
"den Schlüsselbund und versuchen Sie es erneut"

#. TRANSLATORS: shown instead of a fresh sign-in window when
#. the system has no keyring service at all, so a token
#. obtained by signing in could not be saved anywhere.
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-core/src/oauth2.rs:892
msgid ""
""
"this system has no keyring service to store an OAuth 2.0 token in, so "
"signing in again would not keep this account signed in; enable a keyring "
"service and try again"
msgstr ""
"dieses System verfügt über keinen Schlüsselbunddienst zum Speichern"
"eines OAuth-2.0-Tokens, daher würde ein erneutes Anmelden dieses Konto"
"nicht angemeldet halten; aktivieren Sie einen Schlüsselbunddienst und"
"versuchen Sie es erneut"

#. TRANSLATORS: shown when EDS refused an OAuth 2.0 account's
#. access token but did not say why.
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-core/src/oauth2.rs:903
msgid "the account has no OAuth 2.0 access token"
msgstr "das Konto hat kein OAuth-2.0-Zugriffstoken"

#. TRANSLATORS: shown when EDS handed back an OAuth 2.0 access
#. token that was empty rather than absent.
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-core/src/oauth2.rs:934
msgid "the OAuth 2.0 service returned an empty access token"
msgstr "der OAuth-2.0-Dienst gab ein leeres Zugriffstoken zurück"

#. TRANSLATORS: shown when an account's Authentication
#. extension names no host to connect to.
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-core/src/source.rs:139
msgid "the account does not name a JMAP server"
msgstr "das Konto gibt keinen JMAP-Server an"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is the host name the account named.
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-core/src/source.rs:143
#, c-format
msgid "\"%1$s\" is not a valid server host name"
msgstr "»%1$s« ist kein gültiger Servername"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is the host name the account named.
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-core/src/source.rs:148
#, c-format
msgid ""
""
"refusing to contact %1$s without TLS: credentials and contacts would go over "
"the network in the clear"
msgstr ""
"Verbindung zu %1$s ohne TLS verweigert: Anmeldedaten und Kontakte"
"würden unverschlüsselt über das Netzwerk übertragen"

#. TRANSLATORS: shown when Evolution asks a JMAP account to
#. create a collection whose kind the request does not state.
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-collection/src/create_resource.rs:172
msgid "the new collection is neither an address book nor a calendar"
msgstr "die neue Sammlung ist weder ein Adressbuch noch ein Kalender"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is "address book" or "calendar". Shown when
#. the JMAP server behind an account offers no account of that
#. kind at all, so there is nowhere to create one.
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-collection/src/create_resource.rs:184
#, c-format
msgid "this account's JMAP server has no place to create %1$s in"
msgstr ""
"der JMAP-Server dieses Kontos bietet keinen Ort, an dem ein %1$s"
"erstellt werden kann"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is "address book" or "calendar"; %2$s is a
#. developer-facing description of the setting that could not be
#. written. Shown when the collection was made on the server and
#. the local source describing it could not be completed.
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-collection/src/create_resource.rs:193
#, c-format
msgid ""
""
"the %1$s was created on the server, but the source for it could not be "
"written: %2$s"
msgstr ""
"%1$s wurde auf dem Server erstellt, aber die zugehörige Datenquelle"
"konnte nicht geschrieben werden: %2$s"

#. TRANSLATORS: shown when Evolution asks a JMAP account to
#. delete something that is not one of the address books or
#. calendars that account created.
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-collection/src/delete_resource.rs:144
msgid "this is not an address book or a calendar of this JMAP account"
msgstr "dies ist kein Adressbuch oder Kalender dieses JMAP-Kontos"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is "address book" or "calendar". Shown when
#. the JMAP server behind an account offers no account of that
#. kind at all, so the collection cannot be there to delete.
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-collection/src/delete_resource.rs:155
#, c-format
msgid "this account's JMAP server has no %1$s to delete"
msgstr "auf dem JMAP-Server dieses Kontos ist kein %1$s zum Löschen vorhanden"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is a developer-facing reason from Evolution
#. Data Server. Shown when the collection was deleted on the
#. server and the local source describing it stayed behind.
#: rust/crates/jmap-backend-collection/src/delete_resource.rs:167
#, c-format
msgid ""
""
"the collection was deleted on the server, but the source for it could not be "
"removed: %1$s"
msgstr ""
"die Sammlung wurde auf dem Server gelöscht, aber die Datenquelle dafür"
"konnte nicht entfernt werden: %1$s"

#: rust/crates/jmap-config/src/backend.rs:345
msgid "_Server:"
msgstr "_Server:"

#: rust/crates/jmap-config/src/backend.rs:346
msgid "_Port:"
msgstr "_Port:"

#: rust/crates/jmap-config/src/backend.rs:347
msgid "_Username:"
msgstr "_Benutzername:"

#: rust/crates/jmap-config/src/backend.rs:354
msgid "Use a _secure connection (TLS)"
msgstr "Eine _sichere Verbindung verwenden (TLS)"

#: rust/crates/jmap-config/src/backend.rs:359
msgid "A_uthentication:"
msgstr "_Legitimation:"

#: rust/crates/jmap-config/src/backend.rs:387
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Passwort"

#: rust/crates/jmap-config/src/backend.rs:388
msgid "OAuth 2.0"
msgstr "OAuth 2.0"

#: rust/crates/jmap-config/src/backend.rs:391
msgid "API Token"
msgstr "API-Token"

#. TRANSLATORS: shown on the account setup page when no email address has been typed in yet.
#: rust/crates/jmap-config/src/complete.rs:173
msgid "This account has no email address yet."
msgstr "Dieses Konto hat noch keine E-Mail-Adresse."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is exactly what was typed into the email address field.
#: rust/crates/jmap-config/src/complete.rs:177
#, c-format
msgid "\"%1$s\" is not an email address."
msgstr "»%1$s« ist keine E-Mail-Adresse."

#. TRANSLATORS: shown when OAuth 2.0 is picked as the authentication method on the manual server-settings page; this account cannot be set up this way. "Look Up Account Details" is the name of the button on the earlier identity page that sets OAuth 2.0 up automatically instead.
#: rust/crates/jmap-config/src/complete.rs:183
msgid ""
""
"OAuth 2.0 can't be set up manually. Go back and use \"Look Up Account "
"Details\" instead."
msgstr ""
"OAuth 2.0 kann nicht manuell eingerichtet werden. Gehen Sie zurück und"
"verwenden Sie stattdessen »Kontodetails abrufen«."

#: rust/crates/jmap-config/src/config_lookup.rs:347
msgid "Look up JMAP account details"
msgstr "JMAP-Kontendetails abrufen"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is the server this account was discovered
#. against, shown in the account assistant's list of lookup results.
#: rust/crates/jmap-config/src/config_lookup.rs:412
#, c-format
msgid "JMAP account at %1$s, using OAuth 2.0"
msgstr "JMAP-Konto auf %1$s mit OAuth 2.0"

#: rust/crates/jmap-config/src/config_lookup.rs:438
msgid "JMAP account (OAuth 2.0)"
msgstr "JMAP-Konto (OAuth 2.0)"

#. TRANSLATORS: the name of an account type, in the list of account types
#. Evolution offers when adding an account. A protocol name — leave it as it is
#. unless your language writes it in another script.
#: rust/crates/jmap-config/src/oauth2_service.rs:422
#: rust/crates/jmap-mail/src/provider.rs:60
msgid "JMAP"
msgstr "JMAP"

#. TRANSLATORS: shown when a JMAP server's OAuth 2.0 metadata
#. does not list the authorization-code grant.
#: rust/crates/jmap-config/src/oauth2_setup.rs:66
msgid "this server does not offer the OAuth 2.0 authorization-code grant"
msgstr ""
"dieser Server bietet die OAuth-2.0-Autorisierung per Autorisierungscode"
"nicht an"

#. TRANSLATORS: shown when a JMAP server offers no RFC 7591
#. dynamic client registration endpoint.
#: rust/crates/jmap-config/src/oauth2_setup.rs:71
msgid ""
""
"this server offers no OAuth 2.0 client registration; an OAuth 2.0 account "
"against it needs a client id from elsewhere"
msgstr ""
"dieser Server bietet keine OAuth-2.0-Client-Registrierung; ein"
"OAuth-2.0-Konto dafür benötigt eine Client-ID von anderer Stelle"

#. TRANSLATORS: this client's name, shown on the consent page a real identity provider renders.
#: rust/crates/jmap-config/src/oauth2_setup.rs:192
msgid "Evolution"
msgstr "Evolution"

#. TRANSLATORS: shown when the server did not recognise this
#. connection as authenticated at all, rather than rejecting a
#. specific password.
#: rust/crates/jmap-mail/src/connect.rs:253
msgid "the server did not accept the account's credentials"
msgstr "der Server hat die Anmeldedaten des Kontos nicht akzeptiert"

#. TRANSLATORS: shown when Camel asks a JMAP store to do
#. something that needs a connection it does not currently have.
#: rust/crates/jmap-mail/src/connect.rs:260
msgid "not connected to the JMAP server"
msgstr "nicht mit dem JMAP-Server verbunden"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is the folder path Camel asked for.
#: rust/crates/jmap-mail/src/connect.rs:264
#, c-format
msgid "no such folder: %1$s"
msgstr "Ordner existiert nicht: %1$s"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is a JMAP mailbox role such as "inbox" or
#. "trash", not translated: it is a protocol keyword, not prose.
#: rust/crates/jmap-mail/src/connect.rs:270
#, c-format
msgid "no mailbox of this account has the %1$s role"
msgstr "kein Postfach dieses Kontos hat die Rolle »%1$s«"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is the message id Camel asked for.
#: rust/crates/jmap-mail/src/connect.rs:275
#, c-format
msgid "no such message: %1$s"
msgstr "Nachricht existiert nicht: %1$s"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is the email address the message was to be
#. sent from.
#: rust/crates/jmap-mail/src/connect.rs:281
#, c-format
msgid "this account cannot send mail as %1$s"
msgstr "dieses Konto kann keine E-Mails als %1$s versenden"

#: rust/crates/jmap-mail/src/connect.rs:285
msgid "this account has no Drafts or Sent folder to send a message from"
msgstr ""
"dieses Konto hat keinen Entwurfs- oder Gesendet-Ordner, aus dem eine"
"Nachricht gesendet werden kann"

#: rust/crates/jmap-mail/src/envelope.rs:101
msgid "sender"
msgstr "Absender"

#: rust/crates/jmap-mail/src/envelope.rs:102
msgid "recipients"
msgstr "Empfänger"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is "sender" or "recipients", already
#. translated.
#: rust/crates/jmap-mail/src/envelope.rs:108
#, c-format
msgid "the %1$s are not internet addresses"
msgstr "bei %1$s handelt es sich nicht um Internetadressen"

#: rust/crates/jmap-mail/src/envelope.rs:112
msgid "the message has no sender address"
msgstr "die Nachricht hat keine Absenderadresse"

#: rust/crates/jmap-mail/src/envelope.rs:113
msgid "the message has no recipients"
msgstr "die Nachricht hat keine Empfänger"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is the recipient's display name.
#: rust/crates/jmap-mail/src/envelope.rs:117
#, c-format
msgid "no address for the recipient \"%1$s\""
msgstr "keine Adresse für den Empfänger »%1$s«"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is the recipient's 1-based position in
#. the list Camel gave, used because this recipient has no
#. display name to show instead.
#: rust/crates/jmap-mail/src/envelope.rs:124
#, c-format
msgid "no address for recipient %1$s"
msgstr "keine Adresse für Empfänger %1$s"

#. TRANSLATORS: the one-line description of the "JMAP" account type, shown
#. beneath its name in the list of account types.
#: rust/crates/jmap-mail/src/provider.rs:67
msgid "For reading and storing mail on JMAP servers."
msgstr "Zum Lesen und Speichern von E-Mail auf JMAP-Servern."

#. TRANSLATORS: the name of an authentication method, in the "Authentication
#. type" list of a JMAP account's settings. "JMAP" is a protocol name — leave it
#. as it is unless your language writes it in another script.
#: rust/crates/jmap-mail/src/sasl.rs:151
msgid "OAuth2 (JMAP)"
msgstr "OAuth2 (JMAP)"

#. TRANSLATORS: the description of the "OAuth2 (JMAP)" authentication method.
#: rust/crates/jmap-mail/src/sasl.rs:163
msgid "Uses an OAuth 2.0 access token to connect to the JMAP server."
msgstr ""
"Verwendet ein OAuth-2.0-Zugriffstoken zum Verbinden mit dem"
"JMAP-Server."

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/link.rs:47
msgid ""
""
"the server rejected the account's credentials — it may need to be signed in "
"again"
msgstr ""
"der Server hat die Anmeldedaten des Kontos abgewiesen; möglicherweise"
"ist eine erneute Anmeldung erforderlich"

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/link.rs:50
msgid "the server refused: this account is not allowed to do that"
msgstr ""
"der Server hat die Aktion verweigert: Dieses Konto ist dazu nicht"
"berechtigt"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is the network error the transport reported.
#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/link.rs:54
#, c-format
msgid "the server could not be reached: %1$s"
msgstr "der Server konnte nicht erreicht werden: %1$s"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is the reason the mail server gave.
#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/link.rs:63
#, c-format
msgid "the server rejected the change: %1$s"
msgstr "der Server hat die Änderung abgewiesen: %1$s"

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/link.rs:212
msgid "the session document names no usable mail account"
msgstr "das Sitzungsdokument nennt kein nutzbares E-Mail-Konto"

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:95
msgid "Checking whether the sending account offers scheduled send…"
msgstr ""
"Es wird geprüft, ob das Absendekonto zeitgesteuertes Senden anbietet …"

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:96
msgid "The selected sending account is not a JMAP account"
msgstr "Das ausgewählte Absendekonto ist kein JMAP-Konto"

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:97
msgid "The account’s server does not offer scheduled send"
msgstr "Der Server dieses Kontos bietet kein zeitgesteuertes Senden an"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is the reason the mail server gave.
#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:99
#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/snooze/action.rs:78
#, c-format
msgid "The account’s server could not be asked: %1$s"
msgstr "Der Server dieses Kontos konnte nicht angefragt werden: %1$s"

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:100
msgid "The server holds the message and sends it at the chosen time"
msgstr "Der Server behält die Nachricht und sendet sie zur gewählten Zeit"

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:103
#, c-format
msgid ""
""
"The message could not be scheduled: %1$s (a copy may remain in the server’s "
"Drafts folder)"
msgstr ""
"Die Nachricht konnte nicht zur zeitgesteuerten Zustellung eingeplant"
"werden: %1$s (eine Kopie verbleibt eventuell im Entwurfsordner des"
"Servers)"

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:105
msgid "The message names no recipients"
msgstr "Die Nachricht nennt keine Empfänger"

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:106
msgid "The message has no From address"
msgstr "Die Nachricht hat keine Absenderadresse"

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:107
msgid "The chosen time is further ahead than the server accepts"
msgstr "Die gewählte Zeit liegt weiter in der Zukunft, als der Server erlaubt"

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:108
#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/snooze/action.rs:82
msgid "The local calendar could not name the chosen time"
msgstr "Der lokale Kalender konnte die gewählte Zeit nicht ermitteln"

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:109
msgid "That time has already passed — choose one in the future"
msgstr ""
"Dieser Zeitpunkt ist bereits vergangen: Wählen Sie einen Zeitpunkt in"
"der Zukunft"

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:289
#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:378
msgid "Send _Later"
msgstr "_Später senden"

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:311
#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:400
msgid "_Custom Time…"
msgstr "_Benutzerdefinierte Zeit …"

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:402
msgid "…"
msgstr "…"

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:866
msgid "Send Later"
msgstr "Später senden"

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:870
msgid "_Cancel"
msgstr "A_bbrechen"

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/extension.rs:875
msgid "_Send Later"
msgstr "_Später senden"

#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/schedule.rs:102
msgid "In One _Hour"
msgstr "In einer _Stunde"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is a time of day, e.g. "18:00".
#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/schedule.rs:234
#, c-format
msgid "Today, %1$s"
msgstr "Heute, %1$s"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is a time of day, e.g. "08:00".
#: rust/crates/jmap-ui/src/send_later/schedule.rs:238
#, c-format
